{"last_link_id": 26, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["输入 | 类型 | 描述\n--- | --- | ---\nmodel | VOXCPM_MODEL | 来自“加载模型”节点的模型\ntext | STRING | 要合成的目标文本\ncfg_value | FLOAT | 引导比例（默认：2.0）\ninference_steps | INT | LocDiT 流匹配步数（默认：10）\nseed | INT | 用于可重现性的随机种子\ncontrol_instruction | STRING | 语音设计模式下的语音描述（可选）\nreference_audio | AUDIO | 用于音色克隆的参考音频（可选）\nultimate_clone | BOOLEAN | 启用终极克隆模式（默认：关闭）\nreference_audio_text | STRING | 参考音频的文本转录；若为空则自动使用 ASR（可选）\nnormalize_text | BOOLEAN | 文本规范化（默认：关闭）\ndenoise_reference | BOOLEAN | 通过 ZipEnhancer 对参考音频降噪（默认：关闭）\nmax_len | INT | 生成期间的最大 token 长度（默认：4096）\nretry_badcase | BOOLEAN | 输出质量较差时自动重试（默认：开启）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [437.6471862792969, 282.0028381347656], "pos": [1607.2845458984375, 1596.62939453125], "id": 24, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "model", "links": [24], "label": "model", "type": "VOXCPM_MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "size": [313.1402282714844, 106], "pos": [765.9685668945312, 1507.254638671875], "widgets_values": ["VoxCPM2", false, "None"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "optimize"}, "name": "optimize", "label": "optimize", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "optimize"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "shape": 7, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "RunningHub_VoxCPM_LoadModel", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RunningHub_VoxCPM_LoadModel"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [22], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [695.6781616210938, 1685.293212890625], "widgets_values": ["今天来玩宇宙服，我玩的是个亚瑟，对面是程咬金。我们的亚瑟一技能可以飞天了，你看，亚瑟飞到天上然后撞过去，程咬金直接被砸到了地里。但他的一技能也变了，他竟然从地里钻了出来，有点意思。连装备也变了，草鞋变成了火箭发射器。但没关系，亚瑟很强，这程咬金是个对手（就算进了太空服我照样能打）。程咬金太惨了，进了太空服还是没有增强，我这种选手都能压着他打。啊不好，李白来抓我了！什么？李白一技能能把我击飞，大招打了我四分之三的血。这太空服的李白太超标了，尽力了。真没见过这样的李白。还好我们家的韩信也赶过来了，一个大招就把李白打变形了，很厉害，我复活了！我的大招变成了能给范围内的敌方英雄闪光效果，就是让别人看不见屏幕吗？那我也太无敌了。不好，程咬金大招怎么变成了奥特曼？又被克制了。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Arabic, Burmese, Chinese, Danish, Dutch, English, Finnish, French, German, Greek, Hebrew, Hindi, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Khmer, Korean, Lao, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Spanish, Swahili, Swedish, Tagalog, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese\n阿拉伯语、缅甸语、中文、丹麦语、荷兰语、英语、芬兰语、法语、德语、希腊语、希伯来语、印地语、印尼语、意大利语、日语、高棉语、韩语、老挝语、马来语、挪威语、波兰语、葡萄牙语、俄语、西班牙语、斯瓦希里语、瑞典语、他加禄语、泰语、土耳其语、越南语\nChinese Dialect: 四川话, 粤语, 吴语, 东北话, 河南话, 陕西话, 山东话, 天津话, 闽南话"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [746.0205688476562, 149.1547393798828], "pos": [-17.630861282348633, 1465.2078857421875], "id": 23, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [603.4358520507812, 323.1331481933594], "pos": [2086.273193359375, 1403.095703125], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 25, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_conn